{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位｜修訂建築物條例(二)\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-23-11-51-21oBKA4fBK.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】題目：修訂建築物條例</p><p>發展局建議修訂建築物條例，引入指明僭建物定義，提高罰則，同時改革對樓宇維修工程的規管，具體如何執行？</p><p>嘉賓：發展局常任秘書長(規劃及地政)何珮玲</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T06:31:28.941076+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":91,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T05:42:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T11:17:32.678656+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T06:24:45.937000+00:00","content_hash":"285cca9fc9c26ce885a397c6deb1d29838ded0d109c4c32df9c369f6182ce469","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}